# The helper hands back its parameter or a record made for it, so `_plain` is proven to hold the function or the record. One of the two bears the name `default`: that one is expected where the name is read, and behind one test
# its slot is read; the read by the name stands on the rare side of that test. It used to be the only way, because the proven type is not layouts alone.
# f2 = run
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: [[plain]]: {{*}} = GetModuleVariable variable=g2
# CHECK-NEXT: = ShapeTest [[plain]] layouts=[L4]
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
